    <string name="howto_title">How to connect</string>
    <string name="howto_body">1. Connect your phone and PC to the same Wi-Fi (or turn on your phone\'s hotspot and join it).\n2. Start the server with the power button.\n3. On Windows: open File Explorer, paste the address in the path bar. On Mac: Finder → Go → Connect to Server. Or use FileZilla, WinSCP, or any FTP app.\n4. Sign in with the username and password shown above.</string>

